VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'been sitting in my cart for like 2 weeks and I finally just caved. And I\'m not going to lie, based on the photos, I was expecting it to look a lot cheaper than this. Like the stitching alone. Look at that. That\'s not the flimsy stuff I'

