AUDIO: 'prove it works everywhere yet. So now I\'ll build a second influencer. This time in one of the biggest niches out there. And it starts in a completely different way from the previous one. It\'s a food reviewer. The guy who films'

[09:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'himself eating and reacting to it on camera. And here\'s the first real difference. With my first character, I locked her face from four real photos. But this guy doesn\'t exist. So, I\'ll build his face straight from a written'

[09:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'description instead. What people get wrong when they describe someone from scratch is they ask for a character who\'s flawless. [music] And that\'s exactly what makes the model overdo it and look fake. So, I\'ll do the opposite and I\'ll ask for a normal guy'

[10:08] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
