[10:34] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'scars on his face because it genuinely looks real. So, I\'ll definitely keep it. So, that\'s a second character built, a completely different person just from a simple prompt. But now when I build his background, there\'s one specific thing I'

[10:48] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'didn\'t have to deal with the first time. And that one thing is the lighting because this time the shot already has real daylight. With the previous one, I had to put a lamp in the room, switch it on, and name a whole film grade just to'

