[11:27] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'natural creases, a real matte dashboard, and no showroom render look. And I\'ll tell it simply that I don\'t want any people, food, or badges in here. Then, I\'ll paste the prompt in and hit generate. And the inside of the car'

[11:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'looks very realistic. So that\'s his whole environment done. But there\'s one thing that makes this build harder than the last one, and that is the part when the [music] character starts to eat. Because this is where the model always'

