VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'wants to make things too [music] clean. The script itself is the same four parts I used for the unboxing video, just about food this time. So I won\'t walk through that part again. And that clean look is the real problem because when a'

[12:05] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'real person eats, it looks messier and slower. The first thing I\'ll do is pick the right food. Something with a clear look that\'s easy to stage and to name on camera, which is why I\'ll go with animalstyle [music] fries. So, I\'ll move'

[12:18] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
