[12:31] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'never both at once, so his words and his chewing never overlap. After a bite, I\'ll have him actually swallow and pause before he reacts, so he\'s never reacting with his mouth still full. I\'ll keep the'

[12:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'reaction small with a slight smile [music] because a shocked reaction looks the fakest when the model generates it. Everything else is the same as the first one, [music] so I\'ll add his character sheet and the car as references. Keep'

[12:55] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the audio on. Make sure I set the aspect ratio to 9x16, resolution to 1080p, the duration to 30 seconds, and the bit rate to standard. Now, I\'ll paste the prompt and hit generate to see if it actually'

