VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'reviewer. So that clean look is the whole appeal for the niche. So, I\'ll go back to the image tab and pick Nano Banana Pro again. And this is the one thing you have to get right. If you only ask for pretty and glowing, the model gives you smooth plastic skin [music]'

[14:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
